```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build artifacts
# NOTE: dist/ is committed on purpose so Vercel can serve it statically
# without running a build step.
build/
*.js.map

# Environment
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Python (if applicable)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```
